      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=28><color=#83E6CD>\u0110I\u1EC0U KHI\u1EC2N & LU\u1EACT</color></size>\n\nWASD di chuy\u1EC3n \u2022 Shift ch\u1EA1y \u2022 Kh\xF4ng c\xF3 nh\u1EA3y\nJ Drive sau n\u1EA3y | K Dink sau n\u1EA3y | L Volley tr\u01B0\u1EDBc n\u1EA3y\nJ+K Drop | J+L Smash b\xF3ng cao | K+L Reset volley\nJ/K/L + U t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng | J/K/L + I ch\xE9o \u2022 T\u1ED1i \u0111a hai n\xFAt\n\nGi\u1EEF \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u1ECDn, th\u1EA3 ph\xEDm g\u1ED1c \u0111\u1EC3 swing; swing tr\u1EC5 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 tr\u01B0\u1EE3t.\nReturn v\xE0 c\xFA th\u1EE9 ba ph\u1EA3i n\u1EA3y. Volley trong Kitchen ho\u1EB7c \u0111\xE0 v\xE0o Kitchen l\xE0 l\u1ED7i.\nT g\u1ECDi time-out tr\u01B0\u1EDBc giao \u2022 Esc d\u1EEBng \u2022 Enter ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c\nC\u1EA3m \u1EE9ng: joystick v\xE0 gi\u1EEF/th\u1EA3 n\xFAt; U/I b\u1EADt t\u1EAFt l\xE0m b\u1ED5 tr\u1EE3."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7a1acc010f3c2904e9e4d597fe6c04cd, type: 2}
